(576,370,$mw$3B9AD1AFBBAC56CCF5AF299EFDCD35B15EABE228D726FE454F66DA0568AC90AF$mw$,$mw$2cc084f8d3f99321a59f15b80ac709bd$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":370,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":14,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"ما محدد \\(\\begin{pmatrix}5&6\\\\0&8\\end{pmatrix}\\)؟","TitleEn":"Find determinant of \\(\\begin{pmatrix}5&6\\\\0&8\\end{pmatrix}\\).","QuestionTextAr":"ما محدد \\(\\begin{pmatrix}5&6\\\\0&8\\end{pmatrix}\\)؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find determinant of \\(\\begin{pmatrix}5&6\\\\0&8\\end{pmatrix}\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قاعدة المحدد للمصفوفة المثلثية: حاصل ضرب عناصر القطر الرئيسي. للمصفوفة [[5،6],[0،8]] نحسب det = 5×8 − 6×0 = 5×8 = 40. وجود صفر تحت القطر يبسط القانون، فلا تسهم القيمة 6 في الحد المطروح.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Triangular matrix determinant equals the product of the main diagonal entries. For [[5,6],[0,8]], det=5×8−6×0=5×8=40. The zero below the diagonal removes the second product.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1469,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"40","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1470,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"41","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1471,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"43","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1472,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"38","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"لاحظ العنصر الصفري تحت القطر.","En":"Notice the zero below the diagonal."},{"Ar":"احسب جداء القطر الرئيسي واطرح جداء القطر الآخر.","En":"Multiply the diagonal entries and subtract the other diagonal product."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما محدد \\(\\begin{pmatrix}5&6\\\\0&8\\end{pmatrix}\\)؟","En":"Find determinant of \\(\\begin{pmatrix}5&6\\\\0&8\\end{pmatrix}\\)."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"40"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $41$ تختلف عن جداء عنصري القطر بمقدار $1$؛ راجع الضرب دون إدخال عناصر أخرى.","En":"Choice $41$ differs from the diagonal product by $1$; recheck the multiplication without introducing other entries."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"41"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $43$ تختلف عن جداء عنصري القطر بمقدار $3$؛ راجع الضرب دون إدخال عناصر أخرى.","En":"Choice $43$ differs from the diagonal product by $3$; recheck the multiplication without introducing other entries."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"43"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $38$ تختلف عن جداء عنصري القطر بمقدار $2$؛ راجع الضرب دون إدخال عناصر أخرى.","En":"Choice $38$ differs from the diagonal product by $2$; recheck the multiplication without introducing other entries."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"38"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"ما محدد \\(\\begin{pmatrix}5&6\\\\0&8\\end{pmatrix}\\)؟","En":"Find determinant of \\(\\begin{pmatrix}5&6\\\\0&8\\end{pmatrix}\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المحدد الثنائي فرق جداءي القطرين؛ في المثلثية يساوي جداء القطر الرئيسي.","En":"A two-by-two determinant subtracts the off-diagonal product; for triangular matrices it is the main diagonal product."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"جداء القطر الرئيسي $5\\cdot8=40$.","En":"The main diagonal product is $5\\cdot8=40$."},{"Ar":"جداء القطر الثانوي $6\\cdot0=0$؛ نطرحه من الأول.","En":"The other diagonal product is $6\\cdot0=0$; subtract it from the first."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$40$","En":"$40$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تجمع عناصر القطر بدلاً من ضربها.","En":"Do not add diagonal entries instead of multiplying."},"FormulaLatex":"\\det\\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\\\c&d\\end{pmatrix}=ad-bc","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5\\cdot8-6\\cdot0=40$","En":"$5\\cdot8-6\\cdot0=40$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"المصفوفة مثلثية علوية؛ محددها حاصل ضرب عناصر قطرها، أي 40.","En":"The upper triangular matrix has determinant equal to the diagonal product, 40."}},"TrackIds":[14,20],"CategoryId":14,"PrimarySkillId":61,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"لاحظ العنصر الصفري تحت القطر.","En":"Notice the zero below the diagonal."},{"Ar":"احسب جداء القطر الرئيسي واطرح جداء القطر الآخر.","En":"Multiply the diagonal entries and subtract the other diagonal product."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المحدد الثنائي فرق جداءي القطرين؛ في المثلثية يساوي جداء القطر الرئيسي.","En":"A two-by-two determinant subtracts the off-diagonal product; for triangular matrices it is the main diagonal product."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"جداء القطر الرئيسي $5\\cdot8=40$.","En":"The main diagonal product is $5\\cdot8=40$."},{"Ar":"جداء القطر الثانوي $6\\cdot0=0$؛ نطرحه من الأول.","En":"The other diagonal product is $6\\cdot0=0$; subtract it from the first."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$40$","En":"$40$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تجمع عناصر القطر بدلاً من ضربها.","En":"Do not add diagonal entries instead of multiplying."},"FormulaLatex":"\\det\\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\\\c&d\\end{pmatrix}=ad-bc","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5\\cdot8-6\\cdot0=40$","En":"$5\\cdot8-6\\cdot0=40$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"المصفوفة مثلثية علوية؛ محددها حاصل ضرب عناصر قطرها، أي 40.","En":"The upper triangular matrix has determinant equal to the diagonal product, 40."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $41$ تختلف عن جداء عنصري القطر بمقدار $1$؛ راجع الضرب دون إدخال عناصر أخرى.","En":"Choice $41$ differs from the diagonal product by $1$; recheck the multiplication without introducing other entries."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $43$ تختلف عن جداء عنصري القطر بمقدار $3$؛ راجع الضرب دون إدخال عناصر أخرى.","En":"Choice $43$ differs from the diagonal product by $3$; recheck the multiplication without introducing other entries."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $38$ تختلف عن جداء عنصري القطر بمقدار $2$؛ راجع الضرب دون إدخال عناصر أخرى.","En":"Choice $38$ differs from the diagonal product by $2$; recheck the multiplication without introducing other entries."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المحدد الثنائي فرق جداءي القطرين؛ في المثلثية يساوي جداء القطر الرئيسي.

$\det\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\c&d\end{pmatrix}=ad-bc$

1. جداء القطر الرئيسي $5\cdot8=40$.

2. جداء القطر الثانوي $6\cdot0=0$؛ نطرحه من الأول.

$5\cdot8-6\cdot0=40$

$40$ بلا وحدة قياس

المصفوفة مثلثية علوية؛ محددها حاصل ضرب عناصر قطرها، أي 40.

لا تجمع عناصر القطر بدلاً من ضربها.$mw$,$mw$A two-by-two determinant subtracts the off-diagonal product; for triangular matrices it is the main diagonal product.

$\det\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\c&d\end{pmatrix}=ad-bc$

1. The main diagonal product is $5\cdot8=40$.

2. The other diagonal product is $6\cdot0=0$; subtract it from the first.

$5\cdot8-6\cdot0=40$

$40$ Dimensionless

The upper triangular matrix has determinant equal to the diagonal product, 40.

Do not add diagonal entries instead of multiplying.$mw$),
