$6$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $42$; choice $48$ requires integration constant $6$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"48"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $42$؛ اختيار $50$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $8$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $42$; choice $50$ requires integration constant $8$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"50"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا \\(y'=6\\) و\\(y(0)=5\\)، أوجد \\(y(7)\\).","En":"Given \\(y'=6\\), \\(y(0)=5\\), find \\(y(7)\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نستعيد الدالة بتكامل مشتقتها واستعمال الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"Recover the function by integrating its derivative and applying the initial condition."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"بالتكامل نحصل على $y=6x+C$.","En":"Integration gives $y=6x+C$."},{"Ar":"باستخدام $y(0)=5$ يكون الحل $y=6x+5$؛ ثم نعوض المدخل المطلوب.","En":"Using $y(0)=5$, the solution is $y=6x+5$; then evaluate the requested input."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$47$","En":"$47$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"Do not omit the initial condition."},"FormulaLatex":"y(x)=y(0)+\\int_0^x g(t)\\,dt","Substitution":{"Ar":"$y(7)=6(7)+5=47$","En":"$y(7)=6(7)+5=47$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(6x+5)'=6,\\quad y(0)=5$","En":"$(6x+5)'=6,\\quad y(0)=5$"}},"TrackIds":[15,21],"CategoryId":15,"PrimarySkillId":68,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بتكامل الطرف الأيمن.","En":"Start by integrating the right side."},{"Ar":"حدد الثابت من قيمة y عند الصفر ثم عوض المدخل المطلوب.","En":"Find the constant from y at zero, then evaluate the requested input."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نستعيد الدالة بتكامل مشتقتها واستعمال الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"Recover the function by integrating its derivative and applying the initial condition."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"بالتكامل نحصل على $y=6x+C$.","En":"Integration gives $y=6x+C$."},{"Ar":"باستخدام $y(0)=5$ يكون الحل $y=6x+5$؛ ثم نعوض المدخل المطلوب.","En":"Using $y(0)=5$, the solution is $y=6x+5$; then evaluate the requested input."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$47$","En":"$47$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"Do not omit the initial condition."},"FormulaLatex":"y(x)=y(0)+\\int_0^x g(t)\\,dt","Substitution":{"Ar":"$y(7)=6(7)+5=47$","En":"$y(7)=6(7)+5=47$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(6x+5)'=6,\\quad y(0)=5$","En":"$(6x+5)'=6,\\quad y(0)=5$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $42$؛ اختيار $45$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $3$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $42$; choice $45$ requires integration constant $3$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $42$؛ اختيار $48$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $6$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $42$; choice $48$ requires integration constant $6$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $42$؛ اختيار $50$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $8$ بدلاً من $5$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $42$; choice $50$ requires integration constant $8$ instead of $5$, violating the initial condition."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نستعيد الدالة بتكامل مشتقتها واستعمال الشرط الابتدائي.

$y(x)=y(0)+\int_0^x g(t)\,dt$

1. بالتكامل نحصل على $y=6x+C$.

2. باستخدام $y(0)=5$ يكون الحل $y=6x+5$؛ ثم نعوض المدخل المطلوب.

$y(7)=6(7)+5=47$

$47$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(6x+5)'=6,\quad y(0)=5$

لا تهمل الشرط الابتدائي.$mw$,$mw$Recover the function by integrating its derivative and applying the initial condition.

$y(x)=y(0)+\int_0^x g(t)\,dt$

1. Integration gives $y=6x+C$.

2. Using $y(0)=5$, the solution is $y=6x+5$; then evaluate the requested input.

$y(7)=6(7)+5=47$

$47$ Dimensionless

$(6x+5)'=6,\quad y(0)=5$

Do not omit the initial condition.$mw$),
(578,372,$mw$8FF1F424E7932562A6DEC57EEC4B70C7CCADC5D3367718CFB91BF4A3B6129F1C$mw$,$mw$236dc1a5ba2501dbe5a29f0218455b88$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":372,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":15,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"إذا \\(y''=0\\) و\\(y'(0)=5\\) و\\(y(0)=6\\)، أوجد \\(y(6)\\).","TitleEn":"Given \\(y''=0\\), \\(y'(0)=5\\), \\(y(0)=6\\), find \\(y(6)\\).","QuestionTextAr":"إذا \\(y''=0\\) و\\(y'(0)=5\\) و\\(y(0)=6\\)، أوجد \\(y(6)\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Given \\(y''=0\\), \\(y'(0)=5\\), \\(y(0)=6\\), find \\(y(6)\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: إذا كانت المشتقة الثانية y″ = 0، فالمشتقة الأولى ثابتة y′ = C₁ والدالة خطية y = C₁x + C₂. من y′(0) = 5 نجد C₁ = 5، ومن y(0) = 6 نجد C₂ = 6. إذن y(6) = 5 × 6 + 6 = 36.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: If y″ = 0, then y′ is constant and y(x) = C₁x + C₂. The conditions y′(0) = 5 and y(0) = 6 yield C₁ = 5, C₂ = 6. Thus y(6) = 5 × 6 + 6 = 36. Differentiate twice to check that y″ = 0.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1477,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"36","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1478,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"37","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1479,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"39","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1480,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"34","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد عدد التكاملات من رتبة المعادلة.","En":"Use the order to determine the number of integrations."},{"Ar":"حدد ثابت كل تكامل من الشرط الموافق له.","En":"Determine each constant using the corresponding condition."}],"Title":{"Ar":"إذا \\(y''=0\\) و\\(y'(0)=5\\) و\\(y(0)=6\\)، أوجد \\(y(6)\\).","En":"Given \\(y''=0\\), \\(y'(0)=5\\), \\(y(0)=6\\), find \\(y(6)\\)."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"36"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $30$؛ اختيار $37$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $7$ بدلاً من $6$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $30$; choice $37$ requires integration constant $7$ instead of $6$, violating the initial condition."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"37"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $30$؛ اختيار $39$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $9$ بدلاً من $6$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $30$; choice $39$ requires integration constant $9$ instead of $6$, violating the initial condition."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"39"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $30$؛ اختيار $34$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $4$ بدلاً من $6$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $30$; choice $34$ requires integration constant $4$ instead of $6$, violating the initial condition."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"34"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا \\(y''=0\\) و\\(y'(0)=5\\) و\\(y(0)=6\\)، أوجد \\(y(6)\\).","En":"Given \\(y''=0\\), \\(y'(0)=5\\), \\(y(0)=6\\), find \\(y(6)\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"تكامل المشتقة الثانية مرتين يعطي دالة خطية بثابتين.","En":"Integrating the second derivative twice gives a linear function with two constants."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"من $y''=0$ يكون $y'$ ثابتاً، والشرط $y'(0)=5$ يحدده.","En":"From $y''=0$, $y'$ is constant, fixed by $y'(0)=5$."},{"Ar":"باستخدام $y(0)=6$ يكون الحل $y=5x+6$؛ ثم نعوض المدخل المطلوب.","En":"Using $y(0)=6$, the solution is $y=5x+6$; then evaluate the requested input."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$36$","En":"$36$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط شرط المشتقة بشرط الدالة.","En":"Do not confuse derivative and function conditions."},"FormulaLatex":"y''=0\\Rightarrow y'=C_1\\Rightarrow y=C_1x+C_2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$y(6)=5(6)+6=36$","En":"$y(6)=5(6)+6=36$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(5x+6)''=0,\\quad y'(0)=5,\\quad y(0)=6$","En":"$(5x+6)''=0,\\quad y'(0)=5,\\quad y(0)=6$"}},"TrackIds":[15,21],"CategoryId":15,"PrimarySkillId":69,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد عدد التكاملات من رتبة المعادلة.","En":"Use the order to determine the number of integrations."},{"Ar":"حدد ثابت كل تكامل من الشرط الموافق له.","En":"Determine each constant using the corresponding condition."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"تكامل المشتقة الثانية مرتين يعطي دالة خطية بثابتين.","En":"Integrating the second derivative twice gives a linear function with two constants."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"من $y''=0$ يكون $y'$ ثابتاً، والشرط $y'(0)=5$ يحدده.","En":"From $y''=0$, $y'$ is constant, fixed by $y'(0)=5$."},{"Ar":"باستخدام $y(0)=6$ يكون الحل $y=5x+6$؛ ثم نعوض المدخل المطلوب.","En":"Using $y(0)=6$, the solution is $y=5x+6$; then evaluate the requested input."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$36$","En":"$36$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط شرط المشتقة بشرط الدالة.","En":"Do not confuse derivative and function conditions."},"FormulaLatex":"y''=0\\Rightarrow y'=C_1\\Rightarrow y=C_1x+C_2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$y(6)=5(6)+6=36$","En":"$y(6)=5(6)+6=36$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(5x+6)''=0,\\quad y'(0)=5,\\quad y(0)=6$","En":"$(5x+6)''=0,\\quad y'(0)=5,\\quad y(0)=6$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $30$؛ اختيار $37$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $7$ بدلاً من $6$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $30$; choice $37$ requires integration constant $7$ instead of $6$, violating the initial condition."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $30$؛ اختيار $39$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $9$ بدلاً من $6$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $30$; choice $39$ requires integration constant $9$ instead of $6$, violating the initial condition."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $30$؛ اختيار $34$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $4$ بدلاً من $6$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $30$; choice $34$ requires integration constant $4$ instead of $6$, violating the initial condition."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$تكامل المشتقة الثانية مرتين يعطي دالة خطية بثابتين.

$y''=0\Rightarrow y'=C_1\Rightarrow y=C_1x+C_2$

1. من $y''=0$ يكون $y'$ ثابتاً، والشرط $y'(0)=5$ يحدده.

2. باستخدام $y(0)=6$ يكون الحل $y=5x+6$؛ ثم نعوض المدخل المطلوب.

$y(6)=5(6)+6=36$

$36$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(5x+6)''=0,\quad y'(0)=5,\quad y(0)=6$

لا تخلط شرط المشتقة بشرط الدالة.$mw$,$mw$Integrating the second derivative twice gives a linear function with two constants.

$y''=0\Rightarrow y'=C_1\Rightarrow y=C_1x+C_2$

1. From $y''=0$, $y'$ is constant, fixed by $y'(0)=5$.

2. Using $y(0)=6$, the solution is $y=5x+6$; then evaluate the requested input.

$y(6)=5(6)+6=36$

$36$ Dimensionless

$(5x+6)''=0,\quad y'(0)=5,\quad y(0)=6$

Do not confuse derivative and function conditions.$mw$),
(579,373,$mw$B71011C9145AEE1D6309A21CDBD4F6831B09F0AD3A91E589FE9AC7AA274A6DB1$mw$,$mw$7929986de2a6b50c1aca60a952e0ab9e$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":373,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":15,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"إذا \\(y'=10x\\) و\\(y(0)=6\\)، أوجد \\(y(5)\\).","TitleEn":"Given \\(y'=10x\\), \\(y(0)=6\\), find \\(y(5)\\).","QuestionTextAr":"إذا \\(y'=10x\\) و\\(y(0)=6\\)، أوجد \\(y(5)\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Given \\(y'=10x\\), \\(y(0)=6\\), find \\(y(5)\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قاعدة تكامل القوى: ∫x dx = x²/2. إذا كانت y′ = 10x، فإن y = (10/2)x² + C = 5x² + C. من y(0) = 6 نحصل على C = 6. بالتعويض x = 5: ‏y(5) = 5 × 5² + 6 = 131. التحقق: المشتقة y′ = 10x.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Power integration rule: ∫x dx = x²/2. Given y′ = 10x, integrate to y = (10/2)x² + C = 5x² + C. Use y(0) = 6 to find C = 6. Then y(5) = 5 × 5² + 6 = 131. Differentiating yields y′ = 10x.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1481,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"132","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1482,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"134","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1483,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"129","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1484,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"131","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بتكامل الطرف الأيمن.","En":"Start by integrating the right side."},{"Ar":"حدد الثابت من قيمة y عند الصفر ثم عوض المدخل المطلوب.","En":"Find the constant from y at zero, then evaluate the requested input."}],"Title":{"Ar":"إذا \\(y'=10x\\) و\\(y(0)=6\\)، أوجد \\(y(5)\\).","En":"Given \\(y'=10x\\), \\(y(0)=6\\), find \\(y(5)\\)."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $125$؛ اختيار $132$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $7$ بدلاً من $6$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variable part is $125$; choice $132$ requires integration constant $7$ instead of $6$, violating the initial condition."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"132"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الجزء المتغير يساوي $125$؛ اختيار $134$ يتطلب ثابت تكامل $9$ بدلاً من $6$، فلا يحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"The variab