elow one in magnitude tend to zero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الأساس $\\frac1{5}$ موجب وأصغر من واحد.","En":"The base $\\frac1{5}$ is positive and less than one."},{"Ar":"كل ضرب جديد بهذا الأساس يصغّر الحد، فتؤول القوى إلى الصفر.","En":"Each multiplication by this base reduces the term, so the powers tend to zero."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0$","En":"$0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الحد الأول بالنهاية.","En":"Do not confuse the first term with the limit."},"FormulaLatex":"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}r^n=0\\quad(|r|<1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}(\\frac1{5})^n=0$","En":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}(\\frac1{5})^n=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$0<(\\frac1{5})^n\\le(\\frac12)^n\\to0$","En":"$0<(\\frac1{5})^n\\le(\\frac12)^n\\to0$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $1$ موجبة ثابتة، بينما يمكن جعل الحد أصغر من أي مقدار موجب بزيادة $n$.","En":"Choice $1$ is a fixed positive value, whereas increasing $n$ makes the term smaller than any positive amount."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $\\frac{1}{5}$ موجبة ثابتة، بينما يمكن جعل الحد أصغر من أي مقدار موجب بزيادة $n$.","En":"Choice $\\frac{1}{5}$ is a fixed positive value, whereas increasing $n$ makes the term smaller than any positive amount."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"خلط نمو المقام أو الأس مع نمو الحد نفسه؛ الحد يتناقص.","En":"Confuses growth of the denominator or exponent with growth of the term; the term decreases."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$قوى نسبة مطلقة أصغر من واحد تؤول للصفر.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}r^n=0\quad(|r|<1)$

1. الأساس $\frac1{5}$ موجب وأصغر من واحد.

2. كل ضرب جديد بهذا الأساس يصغّر الحد، فتؤول القوى إلى الصفر.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}(\frac1{5})^n=0$

$0$ بلا وحدة قياس

$0<(\frac1{5})^n\le(\frac12)^n\to0$

لا تخلط الحد الأول بالنهاية.$mw$,$mw$Powers of a ratio below one in magnitude tend to zero.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}r^n=0\quad(|r|<1)$

1. The base $\frac1{5}$ is positive and less than one.

2. Each multiplication by this base reduces the term, so the powers tend to zero.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}(\frac1{5})^n=0$

$0$ Dimensionless

$0<(\frac1{5})^n\le(\frac12)^n\to0$

Do not confuse the first term with the limit.$mw$),
(583,377,$mw$0A623A070279BA229727E27A614C7FC93366B7CD68C1FF8EE17F2E448E6F7738$mw$,$mw$2f920ffa1671ac5ba29aedd13e43e4b6$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":377,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":13,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"إذا \\(f(x,y)=6x^2y+5y^2\\)، أوجد \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) عند (6،7).","TitleEn":"Given \\(f(x,y)=6x^2y+5y^2\\), evaluate \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) at (6,7).","QuestionTextAr":"إذا \\(f(x,y)=6x^2y+5y^2\\)، أوجد \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) عند (6،7).","QuestionTextEn":"Given \\(f(x,y)=6x^2y+5y^2\\), evaluate \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) at (6,7).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون المشتقة الجزئية بالنسبة إلى ص: نعامل س كثابت. للدالة f(س،ص) = 6س²ص + 5ص² نجد ∂f/∂ص = 6س² + 10ص. عند (6،7) نحسب 6 × 6² + 10 × 7 = 216 + 70 = 286.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Partial derivative with respect to y: Treat x as constant. For f(x,y)=6x²y+5y², ∂f/∂y=6x²+10y. At (6,7), calculate 6×6²+10×7=216+70=286.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1497,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"289","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1498,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"284","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1499,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"286","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1500,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"287","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد المتغير المطلوب.","En":"Identify the differentiation variable."},{"Ar":"اشتق بالنسبة إلى y مع تثبيت x ثم عوض.","En":"Differentiate in y holding x fixed, then substitute."}],"Title":{"Ar":"إذا \\(f(x,y)=6x^2y+5y^2\\)، أوجد \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) عند (6،7).","En":"Given \\(f(x,y)=6x^2y+5y^2\\), evaluate \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) at (6,7)."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"الحدان بعد التعويض هما $216$ و$70$؛ اختيار $289$ يخالف جمعهما بمقدار $3$.","En":"The evaluated terms are $216$ and $70$; choice $289$ differs from their sum by $3$."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"289"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الحدان بعد التعويض هما $216$ و$70$؛ اختيار $284$ يخالف جمعهما بمقدار $2$.","En":"The evaluated terms are $216$ and $70$; choice $284$ differs from their sum by $2$."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"284"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"286"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الحدان بعد التعويض هما $216$ و$70$؛ اختيار $287$ يخالف جمعهما بمقدار $1$.","En":"The evaluated terms are $216$ and $70$; choice $287$ differs from their sum by $1$."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"287"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا \\(f(x,y)=6x^2y+5y^2\\)، أوجد \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) عند (6،7).","En":"Given \\(f(x,y)=6x^2y+5y^2\\), evaluate \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) at (6,7)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نثبت x عند الاشتقاق بالنسبة إلى y ثم نعوض النقطة.","En":"Hold x fixed when differentiating in y, then evaluate at the point."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ثبّت $x$؛ مشتقة $6x^2y$ بالنسبة إلى $y$ هي $6x^2$.","En":"Hold $x$ fixed; the derivative of $6x^2y$ in $y$ is $6x^2$."},{"Ar":"مشتقة $5y^2$ هي $10y$؛ نجمع الحدين ثم نعوض النقطة.","En":"Differentiate $5y^2$ to obtain $10y$; add the terms and evaluate the point."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$286$","En":"$286$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعوض قبل الاشتقاق.","En":"Do not substitute before differentiating."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}=6x^2+10y","Substitution":{"Ar":"$6(6)^2+10(7)=216+70=286$","En":"$6(6)^2+10(7)=216+70=286$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(6,7+h)-f(6,7)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(286+5h)=286$","En":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(6,7+h)-f(6,7)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(286+5h)=286$"}},"TrackIds":[13,21],"CategoryId":13,"PrimarySkillId":57,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد المتغير المطلوب.","En":"Identify the differentiation variable."},{"Ar":"اشتق بالنسبة إلى y مع تثبيت x ثم عوض.","En":"Differentiate in y holding x fixed, then substitute."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نثبت x عند الاشتقاق بالنسبة إلى y ثم نعوض النقطة.","En":"Hold x fixed when differentiating in y, then evaluate at the point."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ثبّت $x$؛ مشتقة $6x^2y$ بالنسبة إلى $y$ هي $6x^2$.","En":"Hold $x$ fixed; the derivative of $6x^2y$ in $y$ is $6x^2$."},{"Ar":"مشتقة $5y^2$ هي $10y$؛ نجمع الحدين ثم نعوض النقطة.","En":"Differentiate $5y^2$ to obtain $10y$; add the terms and evaluate the point."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$286$","En":"$286$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعوض قبل الاشتقاق.","En":"Do not substitute before differentiating."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}=6x^2+10y","Substitution":{"Ar":"$6(6)^2+10(7)=216+70=286$","En":"$6(6)^2+10(7)=216+70=286$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(6,7+h)-f(6,7)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(286+5h)=286$","En":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(6,7+h)-f(6,7)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(286+5h)=286$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الحدان بعد التعويض هما $216$ و$70$؛ اختيار $289$ يخالف جمعهما بمقدار $3$.","En":"The evaluated terms are $216$ and $70$; choice $289$ differs from their sum by $3$."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الحدان بعد التعويض هما $216$ و$70$؛ اختيار $284$ يخالف جمعهما بمقدار $2$.","En":"The evaluated terms are $216$ and $70$; choice $284$ differs from their sum by $2$."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الحدان بعد التعويض هما $216$ و$70$؛ اختيار $287$ يخالف جمعهما بمقدار $1$.","En":"The evaluated terms are $216$ and $70$; choice $287$ differs from their sum by $1$."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نثبت x عند الاشتقاق بالنسبة إلى y ثم نعوض النقطة.

$\frac{\partial f}{\partial y}=6x^2+10y$

1. ثبّت $x$؛ مشتقة $6x^2y$ بالنسبة إلى $y$ هي $6x^2$.

2. مشتقة $5y^2$ هي $10y$؛ نجمع الحدين ثم نعوض النقطة.

$6(6)^2+10(7)=216+70=286$

$286$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\lim_{h\to0}\frac{f(6,7+h)-f(6,7)}{h}=\lim_{h\to0}(286+5h)=286$

لا تعوض قبل الاشتقاق.$mw$,$mw$Hold x fixed when differentiating in y, then evaluate at the point.

$\frac{\partial f}{\partial y}=6x^2+10y$

1. Hold $x$ fixed; the derivative of $6x^2y$ in $y$ is $6x^2$.

2. Differentiate $5y^2$ to obtain $10y$; add the terms and evaluate the point.

$6(6)^2+10(7)=216+70=286$

$286$ Dimensionless

$\lim_{h\to0}\frac{f(6,7+h)-f(6,7)}{h}=\lim_{h\to0}(286+5h)=286$

Do not substitute before differentiating.$mw$),
(584,378,$mw$AB97065249B11CB617E2AFCECF81E14B9DC2525FB70807909BFB43931BD54468$mw$,$mw$7b609d9b408dcc51f8d86d02b180243e$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":378,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":13,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"ما تدرج \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) عند النقطة (6،7)؟","TitleEn":"Find gradient of \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) at (6,7).","QuestionTextAr":"ما تدرج \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) عند النقطة (6،7)؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find gradient of \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) at (6,7).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون التدرج: ∇f(س،ص) = (∂f/∂س،∂f/∂ص). للدالة f(س،ص) = س² + ص²، التدرج هو (2س،2ص). عند النقطة (6،7) تصبح المركبتان (2 × 6،2 × 7) = (12،14). هذا متجه وليس عدداً واحداً.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Gradient rule: ∇f=(∂f/∂x,∂f/∂y). For f(x,y)=x²+y², ∇f=(2x,2y). At (6,7), the result is (2×6,2×7)=(12,14). A gradient is a vector, not a scalar.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1501,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"(12,-14)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1502,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"(12,14)","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1503,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"(6,7)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1504,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"(14,12)","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب المشتقتين الجزئيتين.","En":"Compute both partial derivatives."},{"Ar":"رتب مشتقة x ثم y وعوض النقطة.","En":"Order the x-partial before the y-partial and evaluate."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما تدرج \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) عند النقطة (6،7)؟","En":"Find gradient of \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) at (6,7)."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"غيّر إشارة المشتقة الثانية رغم أن إحداثيها موجب.","En":"Negates the second derivative component despite a positive coordinate."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(12,-14)"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"(12,14)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"أعاد إحداثيي النقطة دون اشتقاق.","En":"Returns input coordinates without differentiating."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(6,7)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"بدّل ترتيب المشتقتين.","En":"Swaps derivative components."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(14,12)"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"ما تدرج \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) عند النقطة (6،7)؟","En":"Find gradient of \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) at (6,7)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التدرج متجه المشتقات الجزئية بالترتيب.","En":"The gradient is the ordered vector of partial derivatives."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نشتق بالنسبة إلى $x$ مع تثبيت $y$ فنحصل على $2x$.","En":"Differentiate in $x$ holding $y$ fixed to get $2x$."},{"Ar":"نشتق بالنسبة إلى $y$ مع تثبيت $x$ فنحصل على $2y$؛ نحافظ على ترتيب المركبتين.","En":"Differentiate in $y$ holding $x$ fixed to get $2y$; retain the component order."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(12,14)$","En":"$(12,14)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تبدل المركبتين.","En":"Do not swap the components."},"FormulaLatex":"\\nabla f=(2x,2y)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\nabla f(6,7)=(2\\cdot6,2\\cdot7)=(12,14)$","En":"$\\nabla f(6,7)=(2\\cdot6,2\\cdot7)=(12,14)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$f_x(6,7)=12,\\quad f_y(6,7)=14$","En":"$f_x(6,7)=12,\\quad f_y(6,7)=14$"}},"TrackIds":[13,21],"CategoryId":13,"PrimarySkillId":59,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب المشتقتين الجزئيتين.","En":"Compute both partial derivatives."},{"Ar":"رتب مشتقة x ثم y وعوض النقطة.","En":"Order the x-partial before the y-partial and evaluate."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التدرج متجه المشتقات الجزئية بالترتيب.","En":"The gradient is the ordered vector of partial derivatives."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نشتق بالنسبة إلى $x$ مع تثبيت $y$ فنحصل على $2x$.","En":"Differentiate in $x$ holding $y$ fixed to get $2x$."},{"Ar":"نشتق بالنسبة إلى $y$ مع تثبيت $x$ فنحصل على $2y$؛ نحافظ على ترتيب المركبتين.","En":"Differentiate in $y$ holding $x$ fixed to get $2y$; retain the component order."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(12,14)$","En":"$(12,14)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تبدل المركبتين.","En":"Do not swap the components."},"FormulaLatex":"\\nabla f=(2x,2y)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\nabla f(6,7)=(2\\cdot6,2\\cdot7)=(12,14)$","En":"$\\nabla f(6,7)=(2\\cdot6,2\\cdot7)=(12,14)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$f_x(6,7)=12,\\quad f_y(6,7)=14$","En":"$f_x(6,7)=12,\\quad f_y(6,7)=14$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"غيّر إشارة المشتقة الثانية رغم أن إحداثيها موجب.","En":"Negates the second derivative component despite a positive coordinate."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"أعاد إحداثيي النقطة دون اشتقاق.","En":"Returns input coordinates without differentiating."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"بدّل ترتيب المشتقتين.","En":"Swaps derivative components."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$التدرج متجه المشتقات الجزئية بالترتيب.

$\nabla f=(2x,2y)$

1. نشتق بالنسبة إلى $x$ مع تثبيت $y$ فنحصل على $2x$.

2. نشتق بالنسبة إلى $y$ مع تثبيت $x$ فنحصل على $2y$؛ نحافظ على ترتيب المركبتين.

$\nabla f(6,7)=(2\cdot6,2\cdot7)=(12,14)$

$(12,14)$ بلا وحدة قياس

$f_x(6,7)=12,\quad f_y(6,7)=14$

لا تبدل المركبتين.$mw$,$mw$The gradient is the ordered vector of partial derivatives.

$\nabla f=(2x,2y)$

1. Differentiate in $x$ holding $y$ fixed to get $2x$.

2. Differentiate in $y$ holding $x$ fixed to get $2y$; retain the component order.

$\nabla f(6,7)=(2\cdot6,2\cdot7)=(12,14)$

$(12,14)$ Dimensionless

$f_x(6,7)=12,\quad f_y(6,7)=14$

Do not swap the components.$mw$),
(585,379,$mw$971BF918B12BA5CBDA37BB6B8D09590371F68C83F9079504B73ADB9C9ECA39DC$mw$,$mw$da9c56e46067be65a516f1b13590d16b$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":379,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":13,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"لدالة \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\)، احسب المشتقة الاتجاهية عند (5،6) باتجاه محور x الموجب.","TitleEn":"For \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\), find directional derivative at (5,6) in positive x-direction.","QuestionTextAr":"لدالة \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\)، احسب المشتقة الاتجاهية عند (5،6) باتجاه محور x الموجب.","QuestionTextEn":"For \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\), find directional derivative at (5,6) in positive x-direction.","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون المشتقة الاتجاهية في اتجاه وحدة u: Dᵤf = ∇f · u. للدالة f(س،ص) = س² + 3ص² يكون ∇f = (2س،6ص). اتجاه س الموجب يساوي متجه الوحدة u=(1،0)، لذا Dᵤf = 2س × 1 + 6ص × 0 = 2س. عند (5،6) الناتج 10.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Directional derivative: D_u f = ∇f · u for a unit direction u. For f(x,y)=x²+3y², ∇f=(2x,6y). The positive x-direction is u=(1,0), so D_u f=2x×1+6y×0=2x. At (5,6), this equals 10.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1505,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1506,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"11","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1507,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"13","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1508,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد متجه وحدة الاتجاه الموجب لمحور x.","En":"Identify the positive x-axis unit direction."},{"Ar":"احسب التدرج عند النقطة ثم اضربه قياسياً في متجه الاتجاه.","En":"Evaluate the gradient at the point and dot it with the direction."}],"Title":{"Ar":"لدالة \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\)، احسب المشتقة الاتجاهية عند (5،6) باتجاه محور x الموجب.","En":"For \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\), find directional derivative at (5,6) in positive x-direction."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"10"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"المركبة الرأسية لا تسهم في هذا الاتجاه؛ القيمة $11$ لا تطابق ضعف الإحداثي الأفقي $5$.","En":"The vertical component contributes nothing in this direction; choice $11$ does not equal twice the horizontal coordinate $5$."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"11"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"المركبة الرأسية لا تسهم في هذا الاتجاه؛ القيمة $13$ لا تطابق ضعف الإحداثي الأفقي $5$.","En":"The vertical component contributes nothing in this direction; choice $13$ does not equal twice the horizontal coordinate $5$."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"13"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"المركبة الرأسية لا تسهم في هذا الاتجاه؛ القيمة $8$ لا تطابق ضعف الإحداثي الأفقي $5$.","En":"The vertical component contributes nothing in this direction; choice $8$ does not equal twice the horizontal coordinate $5$."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"8"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"لدالة \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\)، احسب المشتقة الاتجاهية عند (5،6) باتجاه محور x الموجب.","En":"For \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\), find directional derivative at (5,6) in positive x-direction."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المشتقة الاتجاهية هي الضرب القياسي للتدرج بمتجه وحدة الاتجاه.","En":"The directional derivative is the gradient dotted with the unit direction vector."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المشتقتان الجزئيتان $2x$ و$6y$، ومتجه وحدة الاتجاه هو $(1,0)$.","En":"The partials are $2x$ and $6y$, with direction unit vector $(1,0)$."},{"Ar":"التدرج عند النقطة $(10,36)$؛ الجداء النقطي ينتقي المركبة الأولى.","En":"The gradient at the point is $(10,36)$; the dot product selects the first component."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$10$","En":"$10$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستخدم معيار التدرج بدلاً من إسقاطه الاتجاهي.","En":"Do not use the gradient norm instead of its directional projection."},"FormulaLatex":"D_{\\mathbf u}f=\\nabla f\\cdot\\mathbf u,\\quad \\mathbf u=(1,0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(10,36)\\cdot(1,0)=10$","En":"$(10,36)\\cdot(1,0)=10$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(5+h,6)-f(5,6)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(10+h)=10$","En":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(5+h,6)-f(5,6)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(10+h)=10$"}},"TrackIds":[13,21],"CategoryId":13,"PrimarySkillId":60,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد متجه وحدة الاتجاه الموجب لمحور x.","En":"Identify the positive x-axis unit direction."},{"Ar":"احسب التدرج عند النقطة ثم اضربه قياسياً في متجه الاتجاه.","En":"Evaluate the gradient at the point and dot it with the direction."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المشتقة الاتجاهية هي الضرب القياسي للتدرج بمتجه وحدة الاتجاه.","En":"The directional derivative is the gradient dotted with the unit direction vector."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المشتقتان الجزئيتان $2x$ و$6y$، ومتجه وحدة الاتجاه هو $(1,0)$.","En":"The partials are $2x$ and $6y$, with direction unit vector $(1,0)$."},{"Ar":"التدرج عند النقطة $(10,36)$؛ الجداء النقطي ينتقي المركبة الأولى.","En":"The gradient at the point is $(10,36)$; the dot product selects the first component."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$10$","En":"$10$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستخدم معيار التدرج بدلاً من إسقاطه الاتجاهي.","En":"Do not use the gradient norm instead of its directional projection."},"FormulaLatex":"D_{\\mathbf u}f=\\nabla f\\cdot\\mathbf u,\\quad \\mathbf u=(1,0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(10,36)\\cdot(1,0)=10$","En":"$(10,36)\\cdot(1,0)=10$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(5+h,6)-f(5,6)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(10+h)=10$","En":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(5+h,6)-f(5,6)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(10+h)=10$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"المركبة الرأسية لا تسهم في هذا الاتجاه؛ القيمة $11$ لا تطابق ضعف الإحداثي الأفقي $5$.","En":"The vertical component contributes nothing in this direction; choice $11$ does not equal twice the horizontal coordinate $5$."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"المركبة الرأسية لا تسهم في هذا الاتجاه؛ القيمة $13$ لا تطابق ضعف الإحداثي الأفقي $5$.","En":"The vertical component contributes nothing in this direction; choice $13$ does not equal twice the horizontal coordinate $5$."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"المركبة الرأسية لا تسهم في هذا الاتجاه؛ القيمة $8$ لا تطابق ضعف الإحداثي الأفقي $5$.","En":"The vertical component contributes nothing in this direction; choice $8$ does not equal twice the horizontal coordinate $5$."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المشتقة الاتجاهية هي الضرب القياسي للتدرج بمتجه وحدة الاتجاه.

$D_{\mathbf u}f=\nabla f\cdot\mathbf u,\quad \mathbf u=(1,0)$

1. المشتقتان الجزئيتان $2x$ و$6y$، ومتجه وحدة الاتجاه هو $(1,0)$.

2. التدرج عند النقطة $(10,36)$؛ الجداء النقطي ينتقي المركبة الأولى.

$(10,36)\cdot(1,0)=10$

$10$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\lim_{h\to0}\frac{f(5+h,6)-f(5,6)}{h}=\lim_{h\to0}(10+h)=10$

لا تستخدم معيار التدرج بدلاً من إسقاطه الاتجاهي.$mw$,$mw$The directional derivative is the gradient dotted with the unit direction vector.

$D_{\mathbf u}f=\nabla f\cdot\mathbf u,\quad \mathbf u=(1,0)$

1. The partials are $2x$ and $6y$, with direction unit vector $(1,0)$.

2. The gradient at the point is $(10,36)$; the dot product selects the first component.

$(10,36)\cdot(1,0)=10$

$10$ Dimensionless

$\lim_{h\to0}\frac{f(5+h,6)-f(5,6)}{h}=\lim_{h\to0}(10+h)=10$

Do not use the gradient norm instead of its directional projection.$mw$);
DO $audit$
DECLARE b record; d "CurriculumDraftItems"%ROWTYPE; p "Problems"%ROWTYPE; tr int; sk int; n int; actor int;
BEGIN
 FOR b IN SELECT * FROM reviewed_batch ORDER BY source LOOP
  PERFORM pg_advisory_xact_lock(-b.source::bigint);
  SELECT * INTO STRICT d FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" WHERE "Id"=b.draft FOR UPDATE;
  SELECT * INTO STRICT p FROM "Problems" WHERE "Id"=b.source FOR UPDATE;
  PERFORM 1 FROM "QuestionOptions" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source FOR UPDATE;
  actor:=d."OwnerUserId"; tr:=(b.wizard->'TrackIds'->>0)::int; sk:=(b.wizard->>'PrimarySkillId')::int;
  IF d."SourceProblemId" IS DISTINCT FROM b.source OR d."Revision"<>0 OR d."EditorialStatus"<>'Draft' OR d."PublishedProblemId" IS NOT NULL OR d."SourceFingerprint" IS DISTINCT FROM b.fp OR md5(d."WizardJson") IS DISTINCT FROM b.draft_hash OR upper(encode(sha256(decode(b.source_hex,'hex')),'hex'))<>b.fp OR (SELECT json_build_object('Id',pp."Id",'StageId',pp."StageId",'CategoryId',pp."CategoryId",'Points',pp."Points",'TitleAr',pp."TitleAr",'TitleEn',pp."TitleEn",'QuestionTextAr',pp."QuestionTextAr",'QuestionTextEn',pp."QuestionTextEn",'DetailedSolutionAr',pp."DetailedSolutionAr",'DetailedSolutionEn',pp."DetailedSolutionEn",'YoutubeSolutionUrl',pp."YoutubeSolutionUrl",'EditorialDetailsJson',pp."EditorialDetailsJson",'Options',(select json_agg(json_build_object('Id',o."Id",'Order',o."Order",'LatexCode',o."LatexCode",'IsCorrect',o."IsCorrect") order by o."Order",o."Id") from "QuestionOptions" o where o."ProblemId"=pp."Id"))::jsonb FROM "Problems" pp WHERE pp."Id"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM b.snapshot THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Source/draft conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Users" WHERE "Id"=actor AND "Role"='Admin' AND "IsActive" AND NOT "StaffSetupPending") OR (SELECT count(*) FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" WHERE "SourceProblemId"=b.source AND "EditorialStatus" NOT IN ('Published','Withdrawn'))<>1 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Owner/open-draft conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  PERFORM 1 FROM "LearningTracks" WHERE "Id" IN (SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int) ORDER BY "Id" FOR UPDATE;
  IF NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTracks" WHERE "Id"=tr AND "StageId"=p."StageId" AND "IsPublished" AND "Revision"<2147483647) OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Categories" WHERE "Id"=p."CategoryId" AND "StageId"=p."StageId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumSkills" s JOIN "CurriculumDomains" dm ON dm."Id"=s."DomainId" WHERE s."Id"=sk AND s."StageId"=p."StageId" AND s."CategoryId"=p."CategoryId" AND s."IsPublished" AND dm."IsPublished") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackCategories" WHERE "TrackId"=tr AND "CategoryId"=p."CategoryId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackSkills" WHERE "TrackId"=tr AND "SkillId"=sk) OR (SELECT array_agg("TrackId" ORDER BY "TrackId") FROM "LearningTrackProblems" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY(SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int ORDER BY 1) OR (SELECT array_agg("SkillId" ORDER BY "SkillId") FROM "CurriculumProblemSkills" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY[sk] OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumProblemSkills" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source AND "SkillId"=sk AND "IsPrimary") OR EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds') j(id) LEFT JOIN "LearningTracks" lt ON lt."Id"=j.id::int WHERE lt."Id" IS NULL OR lt."StageId"<>p."StageId" OR lt."Revision">=2147483647 OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackCategories" WHERE "TrackId"=lt."Id" AND "CategoryId"=p."CategoryId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackSkills" WHERE "TrackId"=lt."Id" AND "SkillId"=sk)) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Scope conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Problems" q WHERE q."Id"<>b.source AND q."StageId"=p."StageId" AND (upper(regexp_replace(btrim(q."QuestionTextAr"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g'))=upper(regexp_replace(btrim(p."QuestionTextAr"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g')) OR upper(regexp_replace(btrim(q."QuestionTextEn"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g'))=upper(regexp_replace(btrim(p."QuestionTextEn"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g')))) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Duplicate: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF b.wizard#>>'{Question,Ar}' IS DISTINCT FROM p."QuestionTextAr" OR b.wizard#>>'{Question,En}' IS DISTINCT FROM p."QuestionTextEn" OR length(b.flat_ar)>12000 OR length(b.flat_en)>12000 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Question/length conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  UPDATE "Problems" SET "TitleAr"=b.wizard#>>'{Title,Ar}',"TitleEn"=b.wizard#>>'{Title,En}',"DetailedSolutionAr"=b.flat_ar,"DetailedSolutionEn"=b.flat_en,"EditorialDetailsJson"=b.metadata WHERE "Id"=b.source;
  UPDATE "CurriculumDraftItems" SET "WizardJson"=b.wizard::text,"EditorialStatus"='Published',"Revision"=4,"SubmittedAtUtc"=now(),"ReviewedAtUtc"=now(),"ReviewedByUserId"=actor,"ReviewNote"='Owner-authorized SQL maintenance; AI educational review and source-locked verification. Existing draft owner recorded for attribution; no API login.',"PublishedAtUtc"=now(),"PublishedProblemId"=b.source WHERE "Id"=b.draft;
  UPDATE "LearningTracks" SET "Revision"="Revision"+1 WHERE "Id" IN (SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int);
  INSERT INTO "PlatformActivityEvents"("ActorUserId","ActorRole","Action","Resource","ResourceId","Origin","CreatedAtUtc") SELECT actor,'Admin',action,'EditorialProblem',b.draft::text,'owner_sql',now() FROM unnest(ARRAY['EditorialDraftEdited','EditorialDraftSubmitted','EditorialDraftApproved','EditorialAmendmentPublished']) action;
 END LOOP;
END $audit$;
COMMIT;
